# --- unit declarations ------------------------------------------------------
#
# The audit reads this one file's contents, so these cases assert values rather
# than placement. Every run-and-ship pairing is legal by design; what is
# checked is that each value is one the template recognizes.

fixture "a unit without a declaration fails"
